OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mainly dry with
OL,6,Fvariable amounts of cloud and some
OL,7,Fbright or sunny intervals. Chance of a
OL,8,Flight shower at first along the north
OL,9,Fcoast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,12,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,13,Facross all parts with clear periods
OL,14,Fand a few fog patches.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FFog patches soon clearing to
OL,17,Fleave a dry day with some warm
OL,18,Fsunshine, high cloud spilling north
OL,19,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
